msgstr "TELs, drone ports and aircraft strike points on the map. Enemy AD shoots some down — hit several targets at once."

#. cat=static zone=ui uses=1
#: ui/ui24/help_tips.gd:24
msgid "Тап по морбазе — верфь: корпус и модули, цена и время внизу. Готовый корабль спускают на воду рядом."
msgstr "Tap a naval base for the shipyard: hull and modules, price and time at the bottom. A finished ship is launched nearby."

#. cat=static zone=ui uses=1
#: ui/ui24/help_tips.gd:25
